{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a traditional marble\u00a0rolling game, where your\u00a0objective\u00a0is\u00a0to roll your way to the\u00a0end\u00a0of each stage. However, there's just one catch:\u00a0you\u00a0have\u00a0to\u00a0do\u00a0it all while attached to\u00a0a\u00a0giant\u00a0ball\u00a0and\u00a0chain! Collect coins, reach the goal, and make your\u00a0way to the end of each stage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Extra Challenging Bonus Stages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593730/extras/multiplayer_gif.gif?t=1746312485\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roll Alone or Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play by yourself, tied to a giant ball and chain, or play online, chained to up to 3 of your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Waddle and Roll, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 3 different styles of play, including Challenge Mode, Race, and Free Play. Also, you can collect cosmetics and customize your very own Penguin Ball &amp; Chain!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fully Simulated Ball and Chain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ball and chain isn't just dead weight: it interacts with the world, too! Use it to zipline across tight platforms and cross otherwise impossible obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593730/extras/penguin_surfing.gif?t=1746312485\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593730?t=1746312485","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593730?t=1746312485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593730/0e708e89f7e1760d12bb4c26280d06ea32777701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746312485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593730/0e708e89f7e1760d12bb4c26280d06ea32777701/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746312485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a traditional marble\u00a0rolling game, where your\u00a0objective\u00a0is\u00a0to roll your way to the\u00a0end\u00a0of each stage. However, there's just one catch:\u00a0you\u00a0have\u00a0to\u00a0do\u00a0it all while attached to\u00a0a\u00a0giant\u00a0ball\u00a0and\u00a0chain! Collect coins, reach the goal, and make your\u00a0way to the end of each stage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Extra Challenging Bonus Stages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593730/extras/multiplayer_gif.gif?t=1746312485\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roll Alone or Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play by yourself, tied to a giant ball and chain, or play online, chained to up to 3 of your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Waddle and Roll, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 3 different styles of play, including Challenge Mode, Race, and Free Play. Also, you can collect cosmetics and customize your very own Penguin Ball &amp; Chain!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fully Simulated Ball and Chain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ball and chain isn't just dead weight: it interacts with the world, too! Use it to zipline across tight platforms and cross otherwise impossible obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593730/extras/penguin_surfing.gif?t=1746312485\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["frogtoad"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3593660","name":"Super Penguin Ball & Chain"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593730/35387311dd2508e1d967f45a9ca65f4b54f31d17/header.jpg?t=1746312485","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Trailer Music: <i>Furious Freak</i> Kevin MacLeod <br>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0<br>","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115839,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115839/movie480.mp4?t=1746089410","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115839/movie_max.mp4?t=1746089410"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115839/f467583822b34e7161015b736ddc4d2f43193dfc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746089410","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115839/movie480_vp9.webm?t=17460894